# Freminet Furina Rosaria Xianyun. ~20s Rot. PF Freminet Phys plunge with C6 Rosaria Phys shred. Executes 1 Shattering Pressure combo while plunging. Rosaria and Furina Freeze opponents for Freminet's Shatter cons; -9K DPS with Freeze immunity. CR cap is real; PF > MH. OHC > SoDP Xianyun, but bubbles may miss. 50% Collisions.

# Team - Options ordered by DPS
freminet char lvl=90/90 cons=6 talent=9,9,9;
